flowchart LR
  REQ[Requirement] -->|implemented_by| COM[Commit]
  COM -->|verified_by| TEST[Test]
  TEST -->|produces| EV[Evidence]
  REQ -->|accepted_by| UAT[UAT Acceptance]
  UAT -->|supported_by| EV
  ADR[ADR] -->|governs| COMP[Component]
  COMP -->|contained_in| SYS[C4 Container/System]
  AG[Agent Execution] -->|read| ADR
  AG -->|produced| FIND[Finding]
  FIND -->|affects| COMP
  REL[Release] -->|contains| COM
  REL -->|satisfied_by| UAT
